=== READING ===
Worst quiet-machine run (3.9 s) sits inside a 5 s default timeout with
~1 s of headroom; the browser-observed 8.5 s stall exceeds it and matches a
P2034 rollback surfacing as 500. Hypothesis SUPPORTED: occasional 500s are
the default 5 s interactive-transaction timeout under latency, not a logic
bug. Fix direction: explicit { maxWait: 10000, timeout: 20000 } on the two
long user-facing transactions (finalize + promo redeem), nothing blanket.
